  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nuclear Safety in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the administrative and inspection capacities of Ukraine authorities to: 
&#x2022; Reduce the risk of serious accidents and pollution from nuclear facilities.
&#x2022; Prevent nuclear and other radioactive materials from falling into the wrong hands.
&#x2022; Regain regulatory control off and rebuilding nuclear power plants under Russian occupation.
&#x2022; Mapping and control of nuclear waste

Delegation of grant management under the Nansen Programme to the Directorate for Nuclear Safety (DSA).</narrative>
  </description>
